n the ground' as Putin stops airstrikes on Kyiv for three days amid peace talks", "url": "https://www.dailymail.com/news/article-16107335/Jared-Kushner-Steve-Witkoffs-private-jet-lands-Moscow-start-latest-US-bid-end-Ukraine-war.html?ns_mchannel=rss&ito=1490&ns_campaign=1490", "summary": "It comes after Trump said on Friday that the envoys were heading abroad to attempt to reach a peace deal between Russia and Ukraine.", "published_at": "2026-09-05T13:27:37+00:00", "image_url": "https://i.dailymail.com/1s/2026/09/05/09/111068083-0-image-m-10_1788598520163.jpg", "source": {"name": "Daily Mail", "tier": "international", "url": "https://www.dailymail.co.uk"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 10, "opinion_fact": 25, "factual_rigor": 50, "framing": 16, "confidence": 0.7, "rationale": {"framing": {"connotation_score": 12.6, "keyword_emphasis_score": 0.0, "omission_score": 31.0, "headline_body_divergence": 34.5, "has_cluster_context": true}}}]}}, {"article": {"id": "eda47602-8c98-4ca6-b513-fa479da6aca5", "title": "Putin orders 72-hour pause in strikes on Kyiv as US envoys visit Russia, Ukraine", "url": "https://www.greaterkashmir.com/world/putin-orders-72-hour-pause-in-strikes-on-kyiv-as-us-envoys-visit-russia-ukraine-12496684", "summary": "Moscow, Sep 5:Russian President Vladimir Putin ordered a 72-hour pause in strikes on Kyiv, the Kremlin said Saturday, as US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner arrived in Moscow to try to revive a stalled push to end Russia's full-scale invasion of Ukraine.“Putin has ordered that no strikes be carried out against Kyiv for three days, starting at midnight today,” presidential spokesperson Dmitry Peskov told Russia's Tass news agency. He said the decision was tied to preparations for Witkoff and Kushner's planned visit to the Ukrainian capital, which Kyiv has said will take place on Sunday.The envoys' trip comes as both sides escalate aerial attacks, some 4.5-years after the Kremlin's invasion of its neighbour. U